  resident started -> reconcile
  reconciled -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
  built 1 a candidate -> reconcile
  reconciled -> publish 1
  published 1 -> release 1; notify succeeded 1 published 1 run app available
  touched /r/apps/p/main.sld -> arm
  timer -> notify building 2 published 1 run app available; build 2
  built 1 nothing -> notify fatal 2 [unexpected compiler attempt result] published 1 run app available; shutdown; abandon 2; closed
a publication that fails releases the attempt and reports it
  resident started -> reconcile
  reconciled -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
  built 1 a candidate -> reconcile
  reconciled -> publish 1
  published 1: cannot rename build/server -> release 1; notify failed 1 [cannot rename build/server]
a failed build reports its diagnostics and keeps what was published
  resident started -> reconcile
  reconciled -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
  built 1 a candidate -> reconcile
  reconciled -> publish 1
  published 1 -> release 1; notify succeeded 1 published 1 run app available
