  built 2 nothing -> reconcile
  reconciled -> abandon 2; notify failed 2 [unbound identifier x] published 1 run app available
a disk that cannot be read discards the candidate until it can
  resident started -> reconcile
  reconciled -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
  built 1 a candidate -> reconcile
  reconcile failed: cannot reconcile /r/apps/p -> discard 1
  discarded 1 -> abandon 1; notify failed 1 [cannot reconcile /r/apps/p]
  uncertain: still failing -> nothing
  uncertain -> arm
  timer -> notify building 2; build 2
a disk that cannot be read at start-up waits for it
  resident started -> reconcile
  build requested -> nothing
  reconcile failed: cannot reconcile /r/apps/p -> notify failed 0 [cannot reconcile /r/apps/p]
  uncertain: still failing -> nothing
  uncertain -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
closing with an attempt in flight abandons it, and nothing after
  resident started -> reconcile
  reconciled -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
  close -> shutdown; abandon 1; closed
  built 1 a candidate -> nothing
  start app -> refuse closed
  close -> nothing
closing while publishing releases
  resident started -> reconcile
  reconciled -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
  built 1 a candidate -> reconcile
  reconciled -> publish 1
  close -> shutdown; release 1; closed
the resident's exit is fatal
  resident started -> reconcile
  reconciled -> arm
  timer -> notify building 1; build 1
  resident exited: status 1: snail: out of memory -> notify fatal 1 [status 1: snail: out of memory]; shutdown; abandon 1; closed
  resident exited: again -> nothing
the resident's exit before the first reconciliation stays what failed
  resident started -> reconcile
  resident exited: SIGKILL -> notify fatal 0 [SIGKILL]; shutdown; closed
  reconciled -> nothing
  timer -> nothing
